
      WRITE TEST PATTERN TO DRUM TRACK 8, 010                             Page 1


    1                   WRITE TEST PATTERN TO DRUM TRACK 8, 010
    2                   / The few implemented PDP1-D instructions
    3       760020      lia=760020
    4       760040      lai=760040
    5       760060      lsw=760060
    6                   
    7                   / This defines the IOT instructions for the Type 23 drum.
    8                   / Note this differs from the examples in that it does not add the iot
    9                   / explicitly, so use is e.g. iot dia.
   10       000061      dia=61
   11       002061      dba=2061
   12       000062      dwc=62
   13       002062      dra=2062
   14       000063      dcl=63
   15       002063      dss=2063
   16                   
   17                   / Additional flags, not compatible with native macro, only macro1.
   18                   / These flags are in the IO register.
   19       400000      drmrd=400000
   20       400000      drmwrt=400000
   21                   
   22                   / Bits for dss
   23       000040      drms16=40
   24       000020      drmsch=20
   25                   
