   43                   / use cpy to copy 0-10 to 100-110
   44 00106 724074           eem
   45 00107 200137           lac (10000
   46 00110 240134           dac ads
   47 00111 200140           lac (10100
   48 00112 240135           dac adt
   49 00113 700010           law 10
   50 00114 170116           jda cpy
   51 00115 760400           hlt
   52                   
   53                   / Copy from one mem bank to another.
   54                   / AC has the count of words to copy.
   55                   / Location ads has the location in the source bank to copy from.
   56                   / Location adt has the destination.
   57                   / Both can have extended addresses.

